**Boundary rules (enforced by this architecture):**

| System | Owns | Reads | Writes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Dashboard PWA | Portfolio UI, authentication, navigation | `portfolio_*` (via Electric), Market Lake API, Hedge API | Nothing (read-only) |
| Hedge API | Hedge runs, results, assumption sets | `portfolio_*` (read-only), Market Lake API | `hedge.*` |
| Market Lake API | Market data serving | Polygon.io, Tradier | DuckDB (unrelated), HTTP responses |
| Life OS | Canonical portfolio data | Broker APIs, bank APIs | DuckDB |
